{"id":"623815","name":"小鱼花生米拍黄瓜","author":"卡老虎大厨","authorId":"10100702","desc":"","cover":"images/623815/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"花生米","amount":"500g"},{"name":"小银鱼","amount":"1袋"},{"name":"黄瓜","amount":"2根"}],"sub":[{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"},{"name":"糖","amount":"适量"},{"name":"醋","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"先加油炒花生米，花生米小火勤折腾，要不容易糊。","img":"images/623815/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"翻炒至噼啪直响。","img":"images/623815/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"勤翻炒，让花生米受热均匀。","img":"images/623815/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"炒完装盘准备。","img":"images/623815/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"再炒小银鱼。","img":"images/623815/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"准备两根黄瓜拍一下，蒜。","img":"images/623815/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放在一起搅拌，加凉拌酱油，盐，糖，醋。","img":"images/623815/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"再加上辣椒油根据自己的口味调制。","img":"images/623815/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"添加麻椒辣椒段，热油浇香。","img":"images/623815/step_9.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}